The `adhd` skill in this directory adapts substantial portions of two sources:

1. The ADHD skill by Udit Akhourii — https://github.com/UditAkhourii/adhd —
   MIT License. Covers the two-phase diverge/focus loop, the general frame
   table, the pre-flight gate, and the anti-patterns list.
2. The pstack `arena` skill by Lauren Tan —
   https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack/skills/arena — MIT
   License. Covers rubric-before-fan-out, a judge from another model family,
   and pick-a-base-then-graft.

FSD-specific additions — the four FSD frames, the two entry contexts, the
switch test, and the routed-findings contract — are part of this repository
and carry its own LICENSE. Both upstream notices follow.

